# Competition Data (per EVALUATION.md §5) -- must not be redistributed/publicly
# shared outside Kaggle's own competition forums/notebooks, and must be deleted
# after the competition ends. Never commit these, even to a private remote you
# might later make public.
dataset/
par_rulebook_en.pdf
ptcg_engine/
sample_submission/sample_submission/cg/

# Deck-builder card data: card-data.js is dataset/EN_Card_Data.csv repackaged as
# JSON, and assets/cards/ is the 1,267 card images (~42 MB). Both are Competition
# Data. Regenerate locally with `python3 deck_builder/generate_card_data.py` --
# the generator IS committed, so nothing is lost by keeping these out of history.
deck_builder/card-data.js
deck_builder/assets/

# Local run artifacts (generated; the HTML replays embed engine/card data)
result.txt
result.html
replay.html

